abstract: "Public Part II origins-of-life archive for Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics (release v1.1.0). Twelve-paper manuscript spine with supplementary scripts, multi-origin convergence diagnostics, interactive panels, bibliography, claim-status ledger, and falsification-centered master synthesis. Life Number and operating-ratio packaging are treated as notation/gauges—not ontology of life. Cites Part I (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20250821) for CDFL. Open preprint; not peer reviewed; not historical validation of any origin pathway."
